  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini into small chunks.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Rinse red lentils.\n• Place zucchini on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9705d1960f8a32f0bf91c-9f42575f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring until softened, 4-5 minutes. Add mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water and coconut milk. Stir to combine.\n• Add lentils to the saucepan. Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to a simmer. Cover with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until the lentils have softened, 24-28 minutes.\n• Stir through roasted zucchini and baby spinach leaves until warmed, 1 minute (if the dhal is looking a little dry, add a splash of water!). Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9705d1960f8a32f0bf91c-cda4be14.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine garlic and a good drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• When the dhal has 10 minutes remaining, slice flatbreads into 3cm strips.\n• Place flatbread strips in a single layer on a second lined oven tray and brush with the garlic oil. Bake until warmed through, 4-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9705d1960f8a32f0bf91c-f28a6c9c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Indian veggie-loaded coconut dhal between bowls.\n• Top with Greek-style yoghurt and tamarind chutney.\n• Serve with garlic dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9705d1960f8a32f0bf91c-3107e9f4.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
